Z||000010||Standard||04-28-2000||12:21 AM||||Geez, take over my thread why dontcha?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <BR>Got my upper ball joint replaced.  Soooo much easier that the lower ball joint.  Front ends a bit tighter now, just have to do the right side ones.  Also finally got my 225/60/15 Comp t/a's installed on the back, they look great!  so nice and wide.. thanks FieroDave!!<P>one thing I noticed about driving around all day in my moms car was that I saw alot more cute women.. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> even got a smile and wave from one of them... oh well.  <BR>Also saw a <I>perfect</I> yellow GT with some 7" wing stands.. to bad he was going the opposite way on hwy 100.<BR>all in all, much better day than yesterday! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
